  "notes": {
    "sections": [
      {
        "title": "Improved",
        "items": [
          "New app icon, Ripple: waves spreading out from a corner. Choose Ripple, Ripple Dark, Light or Dark in Settings → App icon. If you had picked Sunset, Cosmos, Particle or Wave, KiJi now shows Ripple, because those icons were retired."
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "Fixed",
        "items": [
          "Security update for a built-in networking library."
        ]
      }
    ],
    "translations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "sections": [
          {
            "title": "改进",
            "items": [
              "新应用图标 Ripple：波纹从一角向外扩散。可在 Settings → App icon 中选择 Ripple、Ripple Dark、Light 或 Dark。如果你之前选的是 Sunset、Cosmos、Particle 或 Wave，这些图标已停用，KiJi 现在会显示 Ripple。"
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "修复",
            "items": [
              "内置网络库的安全更新。"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "ja": {
        "sections": [
          {
            "title": "改善",
            "items": [
              "新しいアプリアイコン Ripple：角から波紋が広がるデザインです。Settings → App icon で Ripple、Ripple Dark、Light、Dark から選べます。Sunset、Cosmos、Particle、Wave を選んでいた場合、これらのアイコンは廃止されたため Ripple が表示されます。"
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "修正",
            "items": [
              "内蔵のネットワークライブラリのセキュリティアップデート。"
